{"v":1,"book":"Mic","ch":5,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Now gather yourself in troops, O daughter of troops; He has laid a siege against us. With a rod they strike on the cheek The Judge of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"Now "},{"t":"gather","s":["H1413"],"a":[1]},{"t":" yourself in "},{"t":"troops","s":["H1416"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"troops","s":["H1416"]},{"t":"; He has "},{"t":"laid","s":["H7760"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"siege","s":["H4692"],"a":[4]},{"t":" against us. With a "},{"t":"rod","s":["H7626"],"a":[7]},{"t":" they "},{"t":"strike","s":["H5221"],"a":[8]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"cheek","s":["H3895"],"a":[10]},{"t":" The "},{"t":"Judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"(But you, O Bethlehem Ephrathah, So little to be among the thousands of Judah, From you there will come forth to Me He who is to be Ruler in Israel; And His goings forth are from ancient times, From the days of eternity.)","tok":[{"t":"(But you, O Bethlehem Ephrathah, So "},{"t":"little","s":["H6810"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to be among the "},{"t":"thousands","s":["H0505"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[7]},{"t":", From you there will come "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to Me He who is to be "},{"t":"Ruler","s":["H4910"],"a":[12]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; And His goings "},{"t":"forth","s":["H4163"],"a":[14]},{"t":" are from ancient times, From the days of eternity.)"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Therefore He will give them up until the time When she who is in labor delivers the child; Then the remainder of His brothers will return, Along with the children of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore He will give them "},{"t":"up","s":["H5414"],"a":[1]},{"t":" until the "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[3]},{"t":" When she who is in labor delivers the child; Then the remainder of His "},{"t":"brothers","s":["H0251"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Along with the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And He will stand and feed His flock in the strength of Jehovah, In the majesty of the name of Jehovah His God; And they will abide, for now He will be great Unto the ends of the earth.","tok":[{"t":"And He will "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"feed","s":["H7462"],"a":[1]},{"t":" His flock in the "},{"t":"strength","s":["H5797"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", In the "},{"t":"majesty","s":["H1347"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; And they will "},{"t":"abide","s":["H3427"],"a":[8]},{"t":", for now He will be "},{"t":"great","s":["H1431"],"a":[11]},{"t":" Unto the "},{"t":"ends","s":["H0657"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And this One will be the peace. When Assyria comes into our land And when he treads in our palaces, We will raise up against him seven shepherds And eight princes of men.","tok":[{"t":"And this One will be the "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[2]},{"t":". When Assyria "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[5]},{"t":" into our "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[6]},{"t":" And when he "},{"t":"treads","s":["H1869"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in our "},{"t":"palaces","s":["H0759"],"a":[9]},{"t":", We will "},{"t":"raise","s":["H6965"],"a":[10]},{"t":" up against him "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shepherds","s":["H7462"],"a":[13]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"eight","s":["H8083"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"princes","s":["H5257"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And they will waste the land of Assyria with the sword And the land of Nimrod at its entrances. And He will save us from Assyria, When he comes into our land And when he treads in our border.","tok":[{"t":"And they will "},{"t":"waste","s":["H7462"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Assyria","s":["H0804"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[4]},{"t":" And the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Nimrod","s":["H5248"],"a":[7]},{"t":" at its "},{"t":"entrances","s":["H6607"],"a":[8]},{"t":". And He will save us from Assyria, When he "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[12]},{"t":" into our "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[13]},{"t":" And when he "},{"t":"treads","s":["H1869"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in our "},{"t":"border","s":["H1366"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And the remnant of Jacob will be In the midst of many peoples Like dew from Jehovah, Like abundant showers upon the herbage, Which do not tarry for man And do not wait for the sons of men.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"remnant","s":["H7611"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be In the "},{"t":"midst","s":["H7130"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Like "},{"t":"dew","s":["H2919"],"a":[6]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Like abundant "},{"t":"showers","s":["H7241"],"a":[9]},{"t":" upon the herbage, Which do not tarry for "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[15]},{"t":" And do not "},{"t":"wait","s":["H3176"],"a":[17]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the remnant of Jacob will be among the nations, In the midst of many peoples, Like a lion among the beasts of the forest, Like a young lion among the flocks of sheep, Who, if he should pass through, tramples under And tears up, and there is none to deliver from him.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"remnant","s":["H7611"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},